{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44129816",
      "title": "Working with Form Arrays",
      "lectureOrder": 262,
      "videoOrder": 250,
      "sourceHash": "9e9d5c488370d79fedf0b10a4714eeb7fd309ed8678b09d2cc3b7a3324830df1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.87,
          "end": 2.31,
          "en": "Now in our form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.31,
          "end": 5.04,
          "en": "there is still one kind of input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.04,
          "end": 8.4,
          "en": "or to be precise a group of inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.4,
          "end": 10.38,
          "en": "that's not registered yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.38,
          "end": 13.323,
          "en": "And that's this \"How did you find us\" part.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.31,
          "end": 17.67,
          "en": "In the end here, we have three different inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.67,
          "end": 20.91,
          "en": "but of course if we really think about it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.91,
          "end": 24.78,
          "en": "it's one input with a list of values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.78,
          "end": 27.21,
          "en": "that can be checked or unchecked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.21,
          "end": 29.823,
          "en": "That's how we could think about it logically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.81,
          "end": 33.54,
          "en": "And therefore, we could register",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.54,
          "end": 36.6,
          "en": "three individual form controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.6,
          "end": 40.5,
          "en": "and possibly group them together into a form group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.5,
          "end": 43.29,
          "en": "But if we then ever add more options here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.29,
          "end": 46.38,
          "en": "we would also have to add them with different names",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.38,
          "end": 49.26,
          "en": "and so on to our form group here as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.26,
          "end": 51.213,
          "en": "which could quickly get annoying.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.8,
          "end": 57.03,
          "en": "That's why Angular also gives you another kind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.03,
          "end": 62.03,
          "en": "of form control or a form group you can create.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.91,
          "end": 66.453,
          "en": "So let's register a source control here, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.41,
          "end": 70.113,
          "en": "and I will register it as a so-called FormArray.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.75,
          "end": 76.95,
          "en": "And FormArray, just like FormControl and FormGroup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.95,
          "end": 80.82300000000001,
          "en": "must be imported from at @Angular forms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 82.41,
          "end": 85.02,
          "en": "Now a FormArray is meant to be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 85.02,
          "end": 87.39,
          "en": "whenever you have a list of controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 87.39,
          "end": 89.64,
          "en": "where you don't necessarily need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.64,
          "end": 92.553,
          "en": "or want a unique name per a control,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 93.53999999999999,
          "end": 95.75999999999999,
          "en": "but where you instead have a list of controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.75999999999999,
          "end": 98.553,
          "en": "that are meant to work together in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 99.81,
          "end": 102.72,
          "en": "FormArray therefore takes an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.72,
          "end": 105.87,
          "en": "instead of an object as an argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105.87,
          "end": 108.63,
          "en": "And here you now add FormControls,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.63,
          "end": 111.15299999999999,
          "en": "but you don't give those controls any names.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 112.28999999999999,
          "end": 115.95,
          "en": "Instead you just have FormControls with an initial value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 115.95,
          "end": 118.14,
          "en": "if you want to, for example, false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.14,
          "end": 122.01,
          "en": "and I can quickly add three form controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.01,
          "end": 125.373,
          "en": "to represent these three different options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 126.3,
          "end": 129.12,
          "en": "And if I ever add a fourth one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 129.12,
          "end": 133.23,
          "en": "I just have to quickly duplicate this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 133.23,
          "end": 135.21,
          "en": "and we could even write some code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 135.21,
          "end": 138.69,
          "en": "that generates this array dynamically if we wanted to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 138.69,
          "end": 140.57999999999998,
          "en": "We could also generate the options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 140.57999999999998,
          "end": 142.38,
          "en": "in a template dynamically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.38,
          "end": 146.46,
          "en": "But here I'll deliberately keep that all a bit more explicit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 146.46,
          "end": 149.43,
          "en": "so that you fully understand what's going on here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 149.43,
          "end": 152.103,
          "en": "and how these things are related.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 153.45,
          "end": 156.06,
          "en": "But with that, I now got a FormArray that consists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 156.06,
          "end": 158.57999999999998,
          "en": "of three different form controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 158.57999999999998,
          "end": 162.06,
          "en": "and the overall array has a name of \"Source.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 162.06,
          "end": 163.92000000000002,
          "en": "With that in the signup component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.92000000000002,
          "end": 166.5,
          "en": "we still have to link that though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 166.5,
          "end": 169.32,
          "en": "And for that we need to go to the element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.32,
          "end": 172.5,
          "en": "that wraps the different input elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 172.5,
          "end": 174.39,
          "en": "that make up this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 174.39,
          "end": 176.55,
          "en": "So in this case, we can go to the field set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.55,
          "end": 179.52,
          "en": "since that does wrap all these inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.52,
          "end": 184.52,
          "en": "And there we now can use the FormArrayName directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 185.07,
          "end": 189.363,
          "en": "to provide the name of our form array in our form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 190.56,
          "end": 194.22,
          "en": "So in this case here, I chose \"Source\" as a name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 194.22,
          "end": 195.96,
          "en": "and hence that is the name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 195.96,
          "end": 197.913,
          "en": "we have to use in the template here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 198.84,
          "end": 201.63,
          "en": "And then we still need to connect these inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 201.63,
          "end": 205.14,
          "en": "but we simply do that by using FormControlName",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 205.14,
          "end": 207.51,
          "en": "and by giving them incrementing numbers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 207.51,
          "end": 211.893,
          "en": "starting with zero since we're in the end in an array here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 213.15,
          "end": 216.45,
          "en": "And again, we could also dynamically generate that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 216.45,
          "end": 218.85,
          "en": "and automatically set the FormControlName",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 218.85,
          "end": 222.3,
          "en": "to the index of the loop we might be going through.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 222.3,
          "end": 224.19,
          "en": "Here, I'm doing this very explicit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 224.19,
          "end": 229.19,
          "en": "so that it's hopefully clear how this markup in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 229.23,
          "end": 234.23,
          "en": "maps to this form array here in our overall form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 235.609,
          "end": 236.91,
          "en": "But that's then all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 236.91,
          "end": 238.77,
          "en": "With that we can save this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 238.77,
          "end": 242.07,
          "en": "And if I now, for example, check the middle item here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 242.07,
          "end": 245.43,
          "en": "and I click sign up, you will see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 245.43,
          "end": 248.38,
          "en": "that of course in the controls we have this array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 249.81,
          "end": 253.23,
          "en": "and we could now access it to get more information about it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 253.23,
          "end": 256.2,
          "en": "But we also find it in the value property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 256.2,
          "end": 259.983,
          "en": "on the overall form, and their source is an array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 261.03,
          "end": 266.013,
          "en": "where the middle item is true because it is checked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 267.12,
          "end": 270.78,
          "en": "And that is therefore a quick and easy and convenient way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 270.78,
          "end": 274.86,
          "en": "of managing inputs like these check boxes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 274.86,
          "end": 279.24,
          "en": "which in the end together make up an overall input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 279.24,
          "end": 282.693,
          "en": "an overall control, if you want to call it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
